{"4089520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bronzebeard's Tavern 2", "steam_appid": 4089520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5023230], "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW &amp; JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/10c5c85f17461beacd3d8f15bdc05782.avif?t=1787185620\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE A TRAVELLING TAVERN KEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic 1–8 player co-op tavern simulator where you travel across fantasy regions, master unfamiliar cuisines, and serve unpredictable customers under the guidance of legendary tavern mentors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UP TO 8-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run taverns together with your dwarven friends online<strong> (Best with 4 players)</strong>. Band together to keep your mentor's tavern alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMERS WITH BIG PERSONALITIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers with not only big appetites, but big personalities! Every tavern attracts fresh faces, from regular goblins, to bomb-slinging tinkerers, to trash-swallowing frog riders, <strong>each one with unique needs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVEL ACROSS FANTASICAL REGIONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you through a variety of<strong> different taverns</strong>, each with their own layouts, hazards, and way of doing things. From the goblin camps of Grubkeep, to the hostile Burning Ashlands.<br>Every region will push your team to communicate, cooperate and <strong>conquer the chaos together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER NEW DISHES AND CUISINES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region has its <strong>own dishes and cooking styles</strong>. The same ingredients can turn into very different meals depending on who you're serving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY OF PAPA BRONZEBEARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the<strong> Bronzebeard </strong>family as they travel the world,  in an <strong>all-new campaign</strong>. Learning under fabled Tavern Masters and gathering the skills it takes to open the legendary <strong>Bronzebeard’s Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS, CLASSIC BRONZBEARD'S FUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original Bronzebeard’s Tavern you know and love with its own <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, featuring every customer, region, and dish you can imagine in one session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic multiplayer tavern adventure for 1-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with different tavern layouts across different biomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large cast of quirky and unpredictable customers to serve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarf Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw customers and players to wherever you want</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE A TRAVELLING TAVERN KEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic 1–8 player co-op tavern simulator where you travel across fantasy regions, master unfamiliar cuisines, and serve unpredictable customers under the guidance of legendary tavern mentors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UP TO 8-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run taverns together with your dwarven friends online<strong> (Best with 4 players)</strong>. Band together to keep your mentor's tavern alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMERS WITH BIG PERSONALITIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers with not only big appetites, but big personalities! Every tavern attracts fresh faces, from regular goblins, to bomb-slinging tinkerers, to trash-swallowing frog riders, <strong>each one with unique needs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVEL ACROSS FANTASICAL REGIONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you through a variety of<strong> different taverns</strong>, each with their own layouts, hazards, and way of doing things. From the goblin camps of Grubkeep, to the hostile Burning Ashlands.<br>Every region will push your team to communicate, cooperate and <strong>conquer the chaos together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER NEW DISHES AND CUISINES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region has its <strong>own dishes and cooking styles</strong>. The same ingredients can turn into very different meals depending on who you're serving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY OF PAPA BRONZEBEARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the<strong> Bronzebeard </strong>family as they travel the world,  in an <strong>all-new campaign</strong>. Learning under fabled Tavern Masters and gathering the skills it takes to open the legendary <strong>Bronzebeard’s Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS, CLASSIC BRONZBEARD'S FUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original Bronzebeard’s Tavern you know and love with its own <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, featuring every customer, region, and dish you can imagine in one session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic multiplayer tavern adventure for 1-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with different tavern layouts across different biomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large cast of quirky and unpredictable customers to serve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarf Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw customers and players to wherever you want</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A chaotic 1–8 player co-op tavern simulator where you travel across fantasy regions, master unfamiliar cuisines, and serve unpredictable customers under the guidance of legendary tavern mentors.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/a0ed7c86a2603cc1a850f95fdd4b25c6f60c3d2e/header.jpg?t=1787185620", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/2e53a482bc057e807e42041be7a3b0776129f486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787185620", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.st